### ========================================================
### PEDALRAYA API - TESTING DENGAN REST CLIENT (VS CODE)
### ========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET ALL ROUTES - Mengambil seluruh data rute
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 2. GET SINGLE ROUTE - Mengambil rute berdasarkan ID (Sukses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes/route-1
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 3. POST CREATE ROUTE - Menambahkan rute baru (Sukses 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Gowes Keliling Danau BSD Grand City",
  "kategori": "road",
  "lokasi": "BSD City, Tangerang Selatan",
  "jarak": 25.5,
  "elevasi": 120,
  "kesulitan": "mudah",
  "durasi": "1.5 Jam",
  "kondisi": "Aspal Halus & Ramah Pesepeda",
  "rekomendasi": "Cocok untuk Road Bike & Sepeda Lipat",
  "foto": "/assets/images/pexels-run-ffwpu-5687405.jpg",
  "deskripsi": "Rute santai akhir pekan menyusuri area hijau dan danau modern di BSD.",
  "terverifikasi": true
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 4. PATCH UPDATE ROUTE - Mengubah sebagian data rute (Sukses 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routes/route-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kondisi": "Aspal Baru Diaspal Ulang & Sangat Mulus",
  "durasi": "2.0 Jam",
  "jarak": 40.0
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 5. DELETE ROUTE - Menghapus rute berdasarkan ID (Sukses 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/routes/route-5
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SKENARIO ERROR 1: NotFoundException (404 Not Found)
### Mengakses ID rute yang tidak terdaftar di memori backend
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes/route-999-tidak-ada
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 7. SKENARIO ERROR 2: ConflictException (409 Conflict)
### Mencoba menambahkan rute dengan nama yang sudah ada (duplikat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Jalur Kabut Pinus Mangunan",
  "kategori": "gravel",
  "lokasi": "Bantul, Yogyakarta",
  "jarak": 35.0,
  "elevasi": 500,
  "kesulitan": "menengah"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### 8. SKENARIO ERROR 3: BadRequestException (400 Bad Request)
### Validasi class-validator gagal (jarak minus, kategori tidak valid, nama terlalu pendek)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "A",
  "kategori": "pesawat_terbang",
  "lokasi": "Jakarta",
  "jarak": -10,
  "elevasi": -50,
  "kesulitan": "mustahil"
}
